WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Find the turning point in prose

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Summarize the scene’s situation in one sentence.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Find the decision that changes what can happen next.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.060
Compare the character’s words with their action. Explain what the difference reveals.

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:26.760
A character says they are leaving but returns a borrowed book before doing so. The action can reveal care that the dialogue conceals.
